  "goodToKnow": "Das Revier is a territory or district: Tiere verteidigen ihr Revier, das Jagdrevier (hunting ground). In police language, das Revier is a police station or precinct: aufs Revier mitkommen. Das Revier or der Pott is also the nickname of the Ruhr area, Germany's former coal and steel heartland, and das Revierderby is the football derby between Schalke 04 and Borussia Dortmund. From French rivière. Stress: re-VEER."
